":"700x130","subtitle":"The gold cake board under every whole cake. Accent only — never a surface, never text, never a flavour. For warnings use --state-warning, which is butter.","name":"Kinpaku gold"},{"path":"guidelines/colors-ink-on-ground.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"Approved text/ground pairs. Every combination here clears 4.5:1.","name":"Ink on ground"},{"path":"guidelines/colors-sakura.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x140","subtitle":"The signature pink. Only colour allowed to fill a button.","name":"Sakura"},{"path":"guidelines/colors-semantic.card.html","group":"Colors","viewport":"700x166","subtitle":"States reuse flavour colours: success matcha, danger ichigo, warning gold, info sakura.","name":"Semantic states"},{"path":"components/brand/brand.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x880","subtitle":"The identity pieces. One script line per page; flavour lives in the tag.","name":"Brand — Logo, SectionHeading, ProductCard, PriceTag, Note"},{"path":"components/core/core.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x500","subtitle":"Pill buttons, status badges, flavour tags and the default card.","name":"Core — Button, IconButton, Badge, FlavourTag, Card"},{"path":"components/feedback/feedback.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x250","subtitle":"Warm ink scrim, fade + 8px rise. Confirmation copy in the kitchen-table voice.","name":"Feedback — Dialog, Toast, Tooltip"},{"path":"components/forms/forms.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x590","subtitle":"The order form. Every field labelled; hints explain why we ask.","name":"Forms — Input, Select, Checkbox, Radio, Switch, Stepper"},{"path":"components/navigation/navigation.card.html","group":"Components","viewport":"700x290","subtitle":"Underline tabs for menu sections, pills for filters, chevron crumbs.","name":"Navigation — Tabs, Breadcrumb"},{"path":"guidelines/motion-easing.card.html","group":"Motion","viewport":"700x200","subtitle":"Fade + 8px rise, settle easing, no bounce. Hover over the card to replay.","name":"Petal-fall motion"},{"path":"guidelines/motion-hover.card.html","group":"Motion","viewport":"700x220","subtitle":"Hover and click these. Card lifts; button darkens; both press to 0.975.","name":"Hover & press, live"},{"path":"ui_kits/social/index.html","group":"Social","viewport":"1280x760","subtitle":"Six export-sized frames: three 1080 posts, three 1080×1920 stories.","name":"Instagram post & story templates"},{"path":"guidelines/spacing-in-use.card.html","group":"Spacing","viewport":"700x194","subtitle":"Card padding 20, stack gap 8, section gap 48.","name":"Spacing in use"},{"path":"guidelines/spacing-ramp.card.html","group":"Spacing","viewport":"700x175","subtitle":"4px base. --space-5 (20px) is the default padding inside a card.","name":"Spacing ramp"},{"path":"guidelines/surfaces-card-anatomy.card.html","group":"Surfaces","viewport":"700x455","subtitle":"White, 20px radius, no border, shadow-sm. Flavour is a tag — never a coloured stripe.","name":"Card anatomy"},{"path":"guidelines/surfaces-radii.card.html","group":"Surfaces","viewport":"700x150","subtitle":"Nothing in this system has a 0px corner except full-bleed photo bands.","name":"Radii"},{"path":"guidelines/surfaces-shadows.card.html","group":"Surfaces","viewport":"700x178","subtitle":"Mixed from --cocoa-900 rgba(46,26,13) — never black. Soft-box light, not a drop shadow.","name":"Elevation"},{"path":"guidelines/surfaces-states.card.html","group":"Surfaces","viewport":"700x204","subtitle":"Hover darkens, press scales 0.975, focus is a sakura double ring.","name":"Interaction states"},{"path":"guidelines/type-body.card.html","group":"Type","viewport":"700x190","subtitle":"Rounded gothic, kana-native. All body, labels and buttons. SUBSTITUTION.","name":"Body — Zen Maru Gothic"},{"path":"guidelines/type-display.card.html","group":"Type","viewport":"700x172","subtitle":"Headlines 28px+. Tracked -0.015em because Marcellu